# NOTE: gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar is NOT ignored. It is missing because it is a
# binary and could not be produced on the authoring machine. Generate it once with
# `gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.9` and COMMIT it - that is what lets the repo build
# without a preinstalled Gradle.

